{"content":[{"c":["BAKER"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["One who prepares food. In biblical times, the baker operated in the home (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.19.3","r":"Gen.19.3","rawR":"Gen.19.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.19.3","value":"Gen.19.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 19:3"},"), in the public bakery (",{"href":"?bref=Jer.37.21","r":"Jer.37.21","rawR":"Jer.37.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.37.21","value":"Jer.37.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 37:21"},"), and in the palaces of kings and nobles (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.40.1-22","r":"Gen.40.1-22","rawR":"Gen.40.1-22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.40.1-22","value":"Gen.40.1-22"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 40:1-22"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Gen.41.10,13","r":"Gen.41.10,13","rawR":"Gen.41.10,13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.41.10,13","value":"Gen.41.10,13"}],"t":"ref","v":"41:10, 13"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Sam.8.13","r":"1Sam.8.13","rawR":"1Sam.8.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Sam.8.13","value":"1Sam.8.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Sm 8:13"},"), preparing bread and cakes from the basic staples of oil and flour. The Israelites fleeing from Egypt baked unleavened bread for their journey (",{"href":"?bref=Exod.12.39","r":"Exod.12.39","rawR":"Exod.12.39","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.12.39","value":"Exod.12.39"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 12:39"},"). The bread and cakes were baked in some kind of pan or oven (",{"href":"?bref=Lev.2.4","r":"Lev.2.4","rawR":"Lev.2.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Lev.2.4","value":"Lev.2.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lv 2:4"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Lev.26.26","r":"Lev.26.26","rawR":"Lev.26.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Lev.26.26","value":"Lev.26.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"26:26"},"). As Israelite society developed, specialized bakers operated and formed guilds. Some have argued that Hosea was a baker because of his knowledge of baking techniques (",{"href":"?bref=Hos.7.4-8","r":"Hos.7.4-8","rawR":"Hos.7.4-8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Hos.7.4-8","value":"Hos.7.4-8"}],"t":"ref","v":"Hos 7:4-8"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=FoodandFoodPreparation_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"FoodandFoodPreparation_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"FoodandFoodPreparation_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Food and Food Preparation"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Baker","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Gn 19:3","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.19.3","rawQueryValue":"Gen.19.3","sourceRefExact":"Gen.19.3"},{"anchorText":"Jer 37:21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.37.21","rawQueryValue":"Jer.37.21","sourceRefExact":"Jer.37.21"},{"anchorText":"Gn 40:1-22","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.40.1-22","rawQueryValue":"Gen.40.1-22","sourceRefExact":"Gen.40.1-22"},{"anchorText":"41:10, 13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.41.10,13","rawQueryValue":"Gen.41.10,13","sourceRefExact":"Gen.41.10,13"},{"anchorText":"1 Sm 8:13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Sam.8.13","rawQueryValue":"1Sam.8.13","sourceRefExact":"1Sam.8.13"},{"anchorText":"Ex 12:39","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.12.39","rawQueryValue":"Exod.12.39","sourceRefExact":"Exod.12.39"},{"anchorText":"Lv 2:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Lev.2.4","rawQueryValue":"Lev.2.4","sourceRefExact":"Lev.2.4"},{"anchorText":"26:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Lev.26.26","rawQueryValue":"Lev.26.26","sourceRefExact":"Lev.26.26"},{"anchorText":"Hos 7:4-8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ho